## Status
There is no dedicated `src/rag/` module. RAG pieces exist across several modules:

## Retrieval Components
- `src/memory/vector.rs` — Vector similarity search foundation
- `src/memory/episodic.rs` — Event-based retrieval
- `src/utils/rag.rs` — RAG helpers
- `src/utils/semantic_search.rs` — Semantic search
- `src/utils/vector_db.rs` — Vector DB helpers
- `src/utils/embeddings.rs` — Embedding helpers
- `src/utils/knowledge_graph.rs` — Knowledge graph
- `src/agents/repo_explorer/` — Repository exploration / retrieval
- `src/okf/` — OKF knowledge bundles (manifest, fetcher, registry, validator)

